{"id":"3482e8f05d02c6f0","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-embedding.md","title":"Ordinary Structure Embedding","display":"df-embedding — Ordinary Structure Embedding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-embedding","aliases":["17-df-embedding"],"display":"df-embedding — Ordinary Structure Embedding","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-structure]]"],"label_origin":"local-descriptive-label","source_section":"1.3; 3.5","source_result":"isomorphism and isomorphic-embedding conventions; joint embedding and amalgamation usage","source_pages_print":[21,22,195,196],"source_pages_djvu":[37,38,211,212],"source_verification":"component conditions compared with isomorphism and submodel definitions; ordinary embedding interface checked","verification_date":"2026-10-13","source_location_history":{"source_section":"3.5","source_result":"Ordinary/isomorphic embeddings used in the joint embedding and amalgamation definitions","source_pages_print":[195,196],"source_pages_djvu":[211,212]},"source_verification_history":["source terminology compared in OCR; component definition and compatibility with prior local interface checked"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-embedding — Ordinary Structure Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-descriptive-label"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3; 3.5"},{"key":"source_result","html":"isomorphism and isomorphic-embedding conventions; joint embedding and amalgamation usage"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>21</span><span>22</span><span>195</span><span>196</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>37</span><span>38</span><span>211</span><span>212</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"component conditions compared with isomorphism and submodel definitions; ordinary embedding interface checked"},{"key":"verification_date","html":"2026-10-13"},{"key":"source_location_history","html":"<div class=\"property-object\"><div><span class=\"property-key\">source_section：</span>3.5</div><div><span class=\"property-key\">source_result：</span>Ordinary/isomorphic embeddings used in the joint embedding and amalgamation definitions</div><div><span class=\"property-key\">source_pages_print：</span><div class=\"property-array\"><span>195</span><span>196</span></div></div><div><span class=\"property-key\">source_pages_djvu：</span><div class=\"property-array\"><span>211</span><span>212</span></div></div></div>"},{"key":"source_verification_history","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>source terminology compared in OCR; component definition and compatibility with prior local interface checked</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a> 的一阶语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>。\n常元、函数和关系符号分量分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\circ\\bar a\">\\(f\\circ\\bar a\\)</span> 是逐分量施加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 所得的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元组。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 为候选集合函数图；以下定义三元谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\nf:A\\to B\\ \\land\\ \\forall a,b\\in A\\;(f(a)=f(b)\\to a=b)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\;(f(c^{\\mathfrak A})=c^{\\mathfrak B})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in A^n\\;\n\\bigl(f(g^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a))=g^{\\mathfrak B}(f\\circ\\bar a)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in A^n\\;\n\\bigl(\\bar a\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}\\leftrightarrow f\\circ\\bar a\\in R^{\\mathfrak B}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\nf:A\\to B\\ \\land\\ \\forall a,b\\in A\\;(f(a)=f(b)\\to a=b)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\;(f(c^{\\mathfrak A})=c^{\\mathfrak B})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in A^n\\;\n\\bigl(f(g^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a))=g^{\\mathfrak B}(f\\circ\\bar a)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in A^n\\;\n\\bigl(\\bar a\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}\\leftrightarrow f\\circ\\bar a\\in R^{\\mathfrak B}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §3.5 的 isomorphic embedding 指到某个子结构的同构，区别于初等嵌入。上式的关系条件是双向保持；只有同态条件不足以支持图示法与伴随理论。</p>\n<p>本接口从 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fc4d04472af291f6\" href=\"?note=fc4d04472af291f6\" title=\"17-df-fraisse-class\">17-df-fraisse-class</a> 上提。原先的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartIso}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\">\\(\\operatorname{PartIso}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A\\)</span> 在全定义域情形下逐项展开，恰为上式：部分同构中的函数封闭条件自动满足，常元条件变为无条件保持。因此参数次序与原调用点不变。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 pp.195–196，DjVu 211–212，结构嵌入语境及合并性质的定义；逐分量表达是本地展开，不是原书编号定义。</p>\n<p>本次另核原书 §1.3，印刷 pp.21–22（DjVu37–38）：同构的关系双向保持、函数及常元保持与本公式逐项相同；嵌入是到子结构的同构。将值域限制为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[A]\">\\(f[A]\\)</span> 得到该子结构，反向由子结构限制条件还原本公式。这补足比 §3.5 使用语境更直接的来源。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为 [[17-df-first-order-language]] 的一阶语言，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，见 [[17-df-structure]]；$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。\n常元、函数和关系符号分量分别为 $\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}$；$f\\circ\\bar a$ 是逐分量施加 $f$ 所得的 $n$ 元组。$f$ 为候选集合函数图；以下定义三元谓词 $\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为 [[17-df-first-order-language]] 的一阶语言，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，见 [[17-df-structure]]；$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。\n常元、函数和关系符号分量分别为 $\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}$；$f\\circ\\bar a$ 是逐分量施加 $f$ 所得的 $n$ 元组。$f$ 为候选集合函数图；以下定义三元谓词 $\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-fraisse-class","status":"resolved","id":"fc4d04472af291f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本接口从 [[17-df-fraisse-class]] 上提。原先的 $\\operatorname{PartIso}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A$ 在全定义域情形下逐项展开，恰为上式：部分同构中的函数封闭条件自动满足，常元条件变为无条件保持。因此参数次序与原调用点不变。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"B=|\\mathfrak B|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Const}_L,\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n},\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\circ\\bar a","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\;&\nf:A\\to B\\ \\land\\ \\forall a,b\\in A\\;(f(a)=f(b)\\to a=b)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\;(f(c^{\\mathfrak A})=c^{\\mathfrak B})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in A^n\\;\n\\bigl(f(g^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a))=g^{\\mathfrak B}(f\\circ\\bar a)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in A^n\\;\n\\bigl(\\bar a\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}\\leftrightarrow f\\circ\\bar a\\in R^{\\mathfrak B}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartIso}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A","display":false},{"tex":"f[A]","display":false}],"bytes":3154,"backlinks":[{"id":"5b4c86c70dd29331","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。\n$\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 为 [[17-df-embedding]] 的普通结构嵌入；$\\circ$ 为集合函数的复合。\n以下定义理论的一元谓词 $\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)$。所有结构量词都是 ZFC 元语言中的量词，模型类是可定义元类。"},{"id":"fc4d04472af291f6","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 为 [[17-df-embedding]] 的普通结构嵌入；与此前全定义域部分同构的接口等价。"},{"id":"9f3187e8ff79e64e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$；普通嵌入 $\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 见 [[17-df-embedding]]。函数、像集与双射见 [[17-df-set-functions]]。$f$ 为候选集合函数。$\\cong$ 的省略语言下标只在同一个固定 $L$ 下使用；它不是两个结构编码的字面相等。"},{"id":"3784f7fc076663f9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。$\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 且 $f[A]=B$，见 [[17-df-embedding]]。$s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)$、$u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L$，项解释见 [[17-df-term-interpretation]]；$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L$，$\\mathrm{Sat}_L$ 见 [[17-df-satisfaction]]。$f\\circ s$ 为通常函数复合；$\\equiv_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"abf539a1037d08d1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$。\n$T_\\forall$ 见 [[17-df-universal-consequences]]，$\\operatorname{Mod}$ 见 [[17-df-model]]，$\\operatorname{Emb}_L(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 见 [[17-df-embedding]]。\n证明使用 [[17-df-diagram]] 的图示及 [[17-thm-compactness]] 的紧致性。"},{"id":"f952ca09ccc601e4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$；$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 是有限非空集合，$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。$L$ 允许无限多个非逻辑符号。$\\operatorname{Emb}_L$ 见 [[17-df-embedding]]，$\\equiv_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-embedding]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[17-df-deduction-system]]\n[[17-df-definable-closure]]\n[[17-df-definable-set]]\n[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]]\n[[17-df-elementary-chain]]\n[[17-df-elementary-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]\n[[17-df-elementary-eq